SafeDSE includes benchmark inputs derived from DeSyDe
(https://github.com/forsyde/DeSyDe, examples of Rosvall and Sander, TODAES
2017): the application graphs, platform, WCET table, latency and design
constraints in data/rosvall/, and the application graphs in data/apps/
(c_rasta and d_jpegEnc1; d_jpegEnc1.sdf.xml and jpeg_r3.sdf.xml are
multi-rate versions of d_jpegEnc1). WCETs for pattern components were added.
